<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b><i>T. Ronan Kennedy</i></b>. Mr. Kennedy was employed by the Company under an Executive Employment Agreement dated October 1, 2021. Effective November 28, 2025, the Company entered into an Executive<b><i> </i></b>Employment Agreement with Mr. Kennedy to serve as our Chief Executive Officer and Chief Financial Officer (the &#8220;<span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Kennedy Employment Agreement</span>&#8221;). The material terms of the agreement are as follows:</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

