			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 77%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Three years, with the option of extending for additional automatic one-year terms unless either party provides written notice of non-renewal at least 60 days before expiration of the initial term or renewal term.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 23%;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 77%;">&#160;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 23%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i>Annual base salary</i>:</p>
