			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i>Discretionary bonus:</i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:35.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Committee will review his performance on an annual basis, and in connection with such annual review, Mr. Kennedy may be entitled to receive an annual discretionary bonus in such amount as may be determined by the Board, upon the recommendation of the committee, in its sole discretion.</p>
