			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:35.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Mr. Kennedy is entitled to participate in all benefit programs we offer our employees, reimbursement for business expenses and four weeks of paid vacation.</p>
