			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:35.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Kennedy Employment Agreement will terminate upon his death or as follows:</p>
			</td>
