			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i>Disability:</i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:35.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">If we should terminate the Kennedy Employment Agreement as a result of his disability (as defined in the agreement) he is entitled to his base salary for a period of 12 months following the date of termination.</p>
