			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i>By cbdMD for cause or by Mr. Kennedy without cause:</i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:35.6%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">We may terminate the Kennedy Employment Agreement without notice for &#8220;cause&#8221;&#160;(as defined in the Kennedy Employment Agreement) following a 30 day cure period. If we should terminate the Kennedy Employment Agreement for cause, he is not entitled to any compensation or severance benefits. Mr. Kennedy may also terminate the agreement without cause. In such event, he is not entitled to any compensation or severance benefits.</p>
