			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i>By cbdMD other than for cause and not in connection with a change of control:</i></p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 77%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">We may terminate the Kennedy Employment Agreement upon 30 days&#8217;&#160;notice to Mr. Kennedy. In such event, he is entitled to receive his base salary and executive benefits through the remaining period of the then current term of the agreement, and all granted but unvested options or restricted shares shall become fully vested on the date of termination and may be exercised by him for a period of 12 months following the date of termination.</p>
