			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 77%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Constructive termination of the Kennedy Employment Agreement shall occur if we materially breach the agreement, a successor company to us fails to assume the obligations under the agreement, or a material change in Mr. Kennedy&#8217;s duties and responsibilities occurs, all subject to waiver by him. In such event, subject to a 30-day cure period, he is entitled to the same compensation as if we had terminated the agreement without cause.</p>
