			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 77%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">If the Kennedy Employment Agreement is terminated not for cause within two years of a change of control of cbdMD (as defined in the agreement), or in the 90 days prior to a change of control, we are obligated to pay Mr. Kennedy an amount equal to the greater of (i) 1.5 <i>multiplied</i>&#160;by his then base salary, or (ii) the base salary remaining to be paid during the then current term of the agreement, payable in a lump-sum payment on the termination date.</p>
