<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b><i>Bradley Whitford</i></b><i>.</i> Mr. Whitford is an at-will employee with a base salary of $200,000 and eligible for discretionary performance bonuses and participation in the Company&#8217;s equity compensation plans.</p>

